        "Speaker 1: Hehehe, big kitty! Did you secretly pump air into those muscles? They look like they’re about to pop!\nSpeaker 2: Ha! You little brat, your mouth is still as nasty as ever. Want me to shut you up with one punch for five seconds?\nSpeaker 1: Ooh! Is this a contest to see who pops first? I’ve got a rocket launcher—boom! Five seconds? Too long, I only need one second to silence the whole place!\nSpeaker 2: You little troublemaker… are you here to fight in the arena, or to blow it up?\nSpeaker 1: Hmm~ I think both! Breaking stuff and causing chaos are my specialties!\nSpeaker 2: Fine, but just don’t mess with my mom’s casino… or I won’t let you off easy.\nSpeaker 1: Whoa~ so you’re the “Mama’s Boy” champ? Hahaha!\nSpeaker 2: Watch yourself, troublemaker."
